# Polje UI

- Type: D-DIN / D-DIN Bold; fallback IBM Plex Sans. Never Inter as brand face.
- Chrome: near-black `--void`, spectral text, hairline borders, ghost buttons, **4px** radius. No shadows, no fat cards, no purple SaaS.
- Accents (one per widget): leaf, hay, ice, soil, alarm.
- Weather theme via `data-solar` + `data-wx` on `<html>` — farm sensors win over OS theme.
- Operator UI: Croatian first, English toggle. Never all-caps Croatian paragraphs.
- If a screen looks like generic analytics SaaS, throw it away. Full rules: `OPG-IVAN-JOVIC.md` §24.
